      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Joomooda sinyas",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eaweecha ghwalamda orjooga sibanga ak gwayeesha Elisha, “Ng'ula heeda ghamneawa sindi aba madeadaang'u madeayi aamwanang' aba heedeanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi geemuscheey eeweaya ea eahita Yordani, ak gaba siisi lagu geadagi ak geadeaschi heechea eepiidana.” Ghwalamda ak gwayeesha, “Aweayeena.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwalamda siyagi aba jeenyaawa ak gwayeesha, “Geamuscheey mwas adeayeewana fugaagu bea gadiyeeda.” Ghwalamda ak gwayeesha, “Gaydawa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goodeayi saawa. Iidu nea geahita Yordani, geelagu geediga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damanda lajeewa siyagi geeta, hean ghoabita joomoadaanyi jeeda beega. Hean gooyeawda nea gwayi, “Uu! Gaydanaadaan siideanyu haw gabiisa joomooni gaba giirageanda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwalamda siida ASEETA ak gwayeesha, “Goobissa anadeascha?” Ak goohiimsa deascheeda. Ng'ata gwalagu ng'archeanda, ak ghoabuuta deascheedida hean ghwadaah joomooda nea gwanda badayda beega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Elisha ak gwayeesha, “Geani joomoadaang'u.” Hean ghoahaakta geadi ak gageanu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lugooda ng'eanyiida Shaamu geajoar",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda sugoocheanda Shaamu gang'uchi sea fuga Israeli. Ak goobalool fugaaschi bea gadiyeeda nea gwarukusa heechea gwanda museasoadaanyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu gweasa siidida bea ASEETEAN sugoocheanda Israeli iita nea gwayeesha, “Shageada adilaabi naweedida, aba gideaba gaygwasku fuga Shaamu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwanung' sugoocheanda Israeli gaweay buuneeda ea ghwahita heeda rukusa siidida bea ASEETEAN. Gideaba shageada, ak ghoaghu eaweagaaschi nea mii nibwagi gil ghana nibiyeenya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwahirbaban sugoocheanda Israeli aba badaydeaba ng'asheanji, hean gaguursa fugaaschi bea gadiyeeda ak gwayeesha, “Majoohiimnaani aba jeedeanya siida mida meatkweeda sugoocheanda Israeli?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda siyagi aba jeeda fugaaschi bea gadiyeeda ak gwayeesha, “Manda ng'utamiideanyu, Ea sugoocheanda geaghus Elisha was sibaneeda mida Israeli. Rukusa sugoocheanda Israeli ng'asheega ibalooli aba jeeda ghooriidaang'u bea ruweanga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha, “Aweayeena adaaha heeda mida ak abeeda gaydeajeakta buuneeda eamwaghaada.” Geeyeesha “Gwanda ng'eanyiida Dotani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak goojeakta faraasajeega, ea mutukwajeega, ea lugooda saang'a. Ak geahita hoowa eawa hean geeneaweesa mujiineedida meadajeega sean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sakteayda nea gudea duw nea gwarita jarooda siida gadiyeeda siida ASEETA. Ghwadaa lugooda buuneeda, ea faraasajeega ea mutukwajeega, nea nineaweesa mujiineedida. Ghwalamda siidaanyi bea gadiyeeda ak gwayeesha, “Eamuy deanya siideanyu haw gajeesna naaha?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda ak gwayeesha, “Adibeali aba gideaba gea mida meatkweedeanya gaburdeawa gea mida meatkweenyaawa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghamwaash Elisha ASEETA nea gwayi, “Ea NG'UTAMIIDA geamuscheey jaada gheanyangaaschi ghoang'wearda.” Hean ghwajaat NG'UTAMIIDA gheanyangeaba siidida bea gadiyeedean, ang'wearda ghwadaah ghwanyiit heayeedida faraasajeega, ea mutukwajeega yeada beascheeka, nea gwaneaweesa meadajeega sean bea Elisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghapka fuga Shaamu ng'ucheeda, hean ghamwaash Elisha NG'UTAMIIDA nea gwayi, “Nung' gang'oowiidi fiisu.” Ng'ata ghwanung' gang'oowiidi gawuurji gidarukuteayda Elisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Elisha ak gwayeesha saawa, “Naweeda mii nih gil, ak eara mujiini ea mii nih gil. Ayeani geeshteanyu ak gaydaadeagwa heeda siida oogaseadayi.” Hean ghwaat ea ghwahita ng'eanyiida Samariya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea nihita ng'eanyiida Samariya, ghwalamda Elisha ak gwayeesha NG'UTAMIIDA, “Ea NG'UTAMIIDA jaada gheanyangeaba fiisu ghoang'wearda.” Hean ghwajaat Ng'utamiida gheanyanga nyaawa, siing'wearda geadaah geenda bugusta mujiineeda Samariya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghwadaah sugoocheanda fuga Israeli saawa. Ghwalamda ak gwayeesha Elisha, “Bwaabwa gaydabwar saawa? Gaydabwar saawa?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Elisha ak gwayeesha, “Adibwari eaniyean gaybwara fuga miing'waanyani ng'uta ghana ghuweang'daang'u? Iina mukaate ea beega madeanyaawa, gweagiischi nea gwaleeshi ak gabiikta heeda sugoocheanda nyaawa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwasissa ghweelmeeda, hean nea nihit agiischooda ea leeshooda. Gwasiksa gaweay heeda sugoocheanda nyaawa, ak fuga Shaamu ea mutghapka ng'eanyiida Israeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mujiineeda Samariya geeneaweesa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghabwada geat lugoadaanyi sugoocheanda Shaamu was Ben-hadadi ak ghwascheang'da ak gwaneaweesa mujiineeda Samariya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu ghang'eat geejeeda ng'waan aba ng'eanyiida Samariya ea gwaneaweesa, ea gwadiyeada sheayeeda haleanjeeda. Inyeesa uhuuda digeeda geeshaaydaawa lapiyaji haradam nea fiyeega ghariibajeanda beachi jeeda ganakooda geeshaaydaawa lapiyaji iyeenya ea shiliingaji muut. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eaweecha nea gwaneay sugoocheanda Israeli aba uhuuda ghamarda mujiini, hean gaguursa gatmu nea gwayeesha, “Ea ng'utamiideanya was sugoocheanda eaniyean weadaan!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda ak gwayeesha, “Iimiighaweanyi NG'UTAMIIDA, abeeda gaydaweataneayiin? Aba heeda silasa booga ghana heeda simuuriisa difaayi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghoanyaash sugoocheanda gatmooda nea gwayeesha “gabaktaneey naaha?” Gwayeesha gatmoodida, “Gwayeeshiinean gatmooni, ‘Goona orjeedang'u eayaaga ghamneawa, ak gajeayaaga orjeedeanyu numuji.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ng'ata geawali orjeedeanyu ak geayaaji. Iimuchu geayeeshi gatmoodida, ‘Goona orjeedang'u eayaaga,’ nea ghana ea nuwa ghafuy orjeedaanyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iiy sugoocheanda ng'asheandeaba gatmooni, hean ghabwaashaada hang'weakaaschi nea abeeda gwaneay aba uhuuda ghamarda nea gang'ula buuneeda, nea abeeda ea niikwa hang'weaka was guniyajeega aba jih. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayi, “Gagasa ghabwaran ASEETA eara gwasinnean dea muy laabwa hoowa nih, eanean inyas ea mwaalaji gheata Elisha was orjeeda Shafati.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
