            "sid": "2KI 6:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda Elisha goopteada aba gheanyi, nea gwandeayi sea gweargwa. Hean goojeakta sugoocheanda siida ghamwaghaada Elisha, heeda duu gwandeewa siidida naweeda ghwalamda Elisha ak gwayeesha gweargiga, “Ghoadayi siicheagu siida jea ghwahidu ghwalach gheateanyu. Ang'ula amahidu ghoarachi gidaghuuta adaghwahidu gah, nea eara siidaanyi haw meana geeshtaanyi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea gutghoabuut balooldaanyi, goobeeru siidida nea goodeana sugoocheanda. Ak gwayeesha, “Ng'ula sawanadeeni gwaleabu heeda NG'UTAMIIDA! Ghwasaan iijea daamuughu NG'UTAMIIDA ea gooyang'u?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.33"
            ]
          }
        }
